ation updates while running in the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"background, you must use the Core Location framework."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNMapViewDelegate/mapView:didUpdateUserLocation:":{"fragments":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"mapView:didUpdateUserLocation:","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Tells the delegate that the location of the user was updated."}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmapviewdelegate\/mapview:didupdateuserlocation:","role":"symbol","title":"mapView:didUpdateUserLocation:","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapViewDelegate\/mapView:didUpdateUserLocation:","type":"topic","kind":"symbol"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNUserTrackingMode/MLNUserTrackingModeFollowWithHeading":{"fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNUserTrackingModeFollowWithHeading"}],"title":"MLNUserTrackingModeFollowWithHeading","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnusertrackingmode\/mlnusertrackingmodefollowwithheading","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The map follows the user location and rotates when the heading changes."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The default user location annotation displays a fan-shaped indicator with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the current heading. The heading indicator represents the direction the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"device is facing, which is sized according to the reported accuracy."}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNUserTrackingMode\/MLNUserTrackingModeFollowWithHeading","type":"topic"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNUserTrackingMode/MLNUserTrackingModeFollowWithCourse":{"kind":"symbol","title":"MLNUserTrackingModeFollowWithCourse","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"MLNUse